language.name = English
mod.cogwork.name = Cogwork
mod.cogwork.description = Tubes, engines and machines that automate mining, crafting and leveling land. Cuboid loaders keep them working with nobody near.
mod.cogwork.authors = Zorro909
tab.cogwork.cogwork = Cogwork

item.cogwork.wooden_cog = Wooden Cog
item.cogwork.stone_cog = Stone Cog
item.cogwork.iron_cog = Iron Cog
item.cogwork.gold_cog = Gold Cog
item.cogwork.diamond_cog = Diamond Cog
item.cogwork.tuning_wrench = Tuning Wrench
item.cogwork.tuning_wrench.tooltip = Use on a directing tube to change its output, on an engine to turn it.

block.cogwork.stone_tube = Stone Tube
block.cogwork.stone_tube.tooltip = Carries items to the tubes and machines it touches.
block.cogwork.timber_tube = Timber Extraction Tube
block.cogwork.timber_tube.tooltip = Pulls items out of the chests and machines it touches when an engine drives it: one item a stroke with a spring engine, eight with an ember engine. Two of them don't join.
block.cogwork.gilded_tube = Gilded Tube
block.cogwork.gilded_tube.tooltip = Speeds up the items going through it.
block.cogwork.sorting_tube = Sorting Tube
block.cogwork.sorting_tube.tooltip = Every side has its own color, on its arm and beside its row of samples. Click a row with items to set its samples; the items stay with you. Sends each item out of the side whose row holds a sample of it, or else out of a side with an empty row.
block.cogwork.directing_tube = Directing Tube
block.cogwork.directing_tube.tooltip = Sends everything out of one side. Change it with a tuning wrench.
block.cogwork.void_tube = Void Tube
block.cogwork.void_tube.tooltip = Destroys every item that reaches it.

block.cogwork.torque_shaft = Torque Shaft
block.cogwork.torque_shaft.tooltip = Carries energy between engines and machines, and joins any mod's cables.

block.cogwork.spring_engine = Spring Engine
block.cogwork.spring_engine.tooltip = Runs while it gets a redstone signal. Pushes energy into the block its trunk points at.
block.cogwork.ember_engine = Ember Engine
block.cogwork.ember_engine.tooltip = Burns fuel for four times the energy of a spring engine. Stops to cool down when its energy has nowhere to go.

block.cogwork.excavator = Excavator
block.cogwork.excavator.tooltip = Digs out the area marked out by survey markers next to it, else the area of a frame it is placed against, else the area behind it, down to the floor of the world. It runs only on more energy per tick than its standby, which grows with its area; what comes in beyond that sets how fast it digs.
block.cogwork.gantry_frame = Gantry Frame
block.cogwork.assembly_bench = Assembly Bench
block.cogwork.assembly_bench.tooltip = Click its pattern cells with items to lay out a crafting recipe; the items stay with you. Tubes then fill the cells with stacks of their ghosts, and with engine power it makes the recipe again and again, one item of each cell a craft. A timber tube takes the results out.
block.cogwork.leveler = Leveler
block.cogwork.leveler.tooltip = Makes the area behind it, or the one marked out by survey markers next to it, flat at its height: clears up to 16 blocks above and fills holes up to 4 deep with whole blocks from its stock.
block.cogwork.survey_marker = Survey Marker
block.cogwork.survey_marker.tooltip = Place up to three more along two straight lines to mark a rectangle, then put an excavator or a leveler next to one. Use one to see the area; a marker without one puffs.
block.cogwork.cuboid_loader = Cuboid Loader
block.cogwork.cuboid_loader.tooltip = Keeps its own cube (16 by 16 by 16 blocks) loaded with nobody near, so machines there go on working. Its screen switches to keeping everything running there, mobs and growing plants too.
block.cogwork.ultra_cuboid_loader = Ultra Cuboid Loader
block.cogwork.ultra_cuboid_loader.tooltip = Keeps the 7 by 7 cubes around it loaded at its height, three each way. Its screen switches between keeping only machines running there and everything.
item.cogwork.cuboid_lens = Cuboid Lens
item.cogwork.cuboid_lens.tooltip = Held, outlines every cube Cogwork keeps loaded: cyan where a loader keeps machines running, green where it keeps everything, orange around a working excavator or leveler.

